Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 23:00:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 009/106] Revert: remove experimental smart-amp AFE call from
 sm8250.c startup

Caused a real regression on-device: ALSA hw_params started failing
with -EINVAL and PipeWire looped suspended->error on every stream
open, freezing the Settings app. Root cause suspected to be
q6afe_send_generic_param()'s q6afe_port_get_from_id()+q6afe_port_put()
pair racing with or destroying the q6afe-dai.c-owned port state for
the same port id, since q6afe_port_get_from_id() can allocate a fresh
port struct rather than just borrowing the DAI's existing one.

Keeping q6afe_send_generic_param() itself in q6afe.c/h (unused, no
effect) since the underlying AFE_PORT_CMD_SET_PARAM_V2 send mechanism
worked fine (DSP accepted it, ret=0) - only this call site was wrong.
Revisit with a properly scoped port handle (reuse q6afe-dai.c's own,
don't fetch+release a second one) before trying this experiment
again.
---
 sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c | 19 -------------------
 1 file changed, 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
index 1c18be70d..abdf4302d 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c
@@ -117,25 +117,6 @@ static int sm8250_snd_startup(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream)
 			MI2S_BCLK_RATE, SNDRV_PCM_STREAM_PLAYBACK);
 		snd_soc_dai_set_fmt(cpu_dai, fmt);
 		mi2s_set_codec_dai_fmt(rtd, codec_dai_fmt);
-
-		/*
-		 * EXPERIMENTAL: register TI's TAS256x smart-amp AFE module
-		 * with the DSP, mirroring the downstream vendor driver's
-		 * afe_tas_smartamp_set_calib_data() call - not known to be
-		 * required for basic playback (see surya audio investigation
-		 * notes), testing whether it changes anything at all.
-		 */
-		{
-			u32 smartamp_payload[14] = { 1, };
-			int ret;
-
-			ret = q6afe_send_generic_param(cpu_dai->dev, cpu_dai->id,
-				0x11111112 /* AFE_SMARTAMP_MODULE_RX */,
-				0x10012D13 /* CAPI_V2_TAS_RX_ENABLE */,
-				smartamp_payload, sizeof(smartamp_payload));
-			dev_info(cpu_dai->dev,
-				"tas smartamp enable experiment: %d\n", ret);
-		}
 		break;
 	case QUINARY_MI2S_RX:
 		codec_dai_fmt |= SND_SOC_DAIFMT_NB_NF | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_I2S;
